cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the benchmark paper and the archived software release."
title: "Pazy-Winged Aircraft Aeroelastic Control Benchmark"
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
authors:
  - family-names: "Alexeev"
    given-names: "Maxim"
  - family-names: "López Muro"
    given-names: "Juan"
  - family-names: "Burlion"
    given-names: "Laurent"
abstract: >-
  A coupled nonlinear aeroelastic estimation and control benchmark for a
  Pazy-wing aircraft, with scheduled reduced-order models, rigid-flexible
  coupling, moving-horizon estimation, nonlinear model predictive control,
  command fusion, and actuator realization.
